  "about_item": [
    "PACKING LIST : Our pet grooming comb set includes 6 different kinds of flea combs,Professional curved dog eye comb x1,Long handle comb x1, Double sided x1, long needle comb x2, short needle comb x1,Multifunction to meet your different needs.",
