        "title": "Good",
        "text": "They work very wellDifferent sizes for Different types of fur",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 12, 2026",
        "author": "Sharon Thomas",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGSI3RTIC5TRXZURXXFHC57AZM2A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
