      {
        "position": 2,
        "title": "Great variety set of flea combs for a great price!",
        "text": "I have pets and have had to deal with a child with head lice before. So I like to have a few little flea combs on hand at all times.I was so happy to get to review this pack. The handles are sturdy. The tines are evenly spaced and small enough for removing fleas or lice.I often get young feral kittens that come on my property and they are too young to use actual flea medication or treatment on, so they have to be bathed and fleas removed by hand. I have always had only straight edge flea combs. But this set is so fabulous for the curved edge combs! They get around little legs and bellies so thoroughly.They are super easy to clean. Just wash them well and let them dry. The pack is a great quality for the price. The handles are easy to hold. And I didn't notice any odor from the set, which is nice.Happily recommend.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 5, 2026",
        "author": "Amazon Customer",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AGNLXFEW5FRHWXOH3IJPYVH53AJQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "images": [
          "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ln19GNLL.jpg"
        ],
        "helpful_votes": "One person found this helpful"
      },
      {
        "position": 3,
        "title": "Practical, multi-purpose combs",
        "text": "This 6-piece grooming comb set is a versatile addition to my pet grooming supplies for my two dogs and one kitty. The assortment of comb sizes and shapes makes it useful for different grooming tasks, but I do wish it included a simple guide explaining the intended use of each comb. Since several of them look very similar, I had to do my own research before figuring out which worked best for each area. After some trial and error, I ended up labeling the combs so I can quickly grab the right one. My favorites are the long-handled fine-tooth comb for general body grooming, the curved palm comb for my kitty’s daily brushing and loose hair, the small narrow comb for cleaning around my dogs’ eyes, chin, and paws, and the medium narrow comb for grooming their ears, tail, and belly. The combs feel solid in hand and the stainless steel teeth are smooth rather than overly sharp, so they glide through the coat comfortably when used gently. The handles provide a comfortable grip, making routine grooming easier. Overall, this is a practical multi-purpose grooming kit that has worked well for my pets.",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "July 10, 2026",
        "author": "JSL",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHWVUABPFJAGGTL6L7FDZOPYO2GA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
        "images": [
          "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8136lB7EmKL.jpg"
        ],
        "helpful_votes": "One person found this helpful"
      },
      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "A useful, versatile set for flea removal and grooming",
        "text": "**Pros:*** **Variety:** This is an \"overkill\" set in a good way—you get six different sizes and shapes, which makes it easy to find the right tool for flea and tick removal, regardless of your pet's size or coat type.* **Effective Design:** The stainless steel teeth are dense and fine enough for effective flea/tick removal and detangling. The prongs are also blunt enough that they won’t hurt your pet's skin.* **Performance:** These combs are excellent for general grooming and flea control; they do a great job of removing fluff and pests easily.* **Value:** It’s an inexpensive set, and having multiple options is very convenient.**Cons:*** **Build Quality:** The plastic handles feel a bit cheap and I’m concerned they might break over time. It would have been nicer to have a more consistent, ergonomic, or rubberized grip, though I understand that might increase the price.**Bottom Line:**This is a solid, practical set for flea removal and grooming. While I personally only use two of the six combs for my Chihuahua, having the variety is helpful. Despite the basic handle construction, they perform their job well and are a recommended purchase for the price.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 11, 2026",
        "author": "With Love from Dracula's Land",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEIRJKBYEVPRDU7UNHB4632YKBCA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/79264cd9-c87e-4b32-820b-31686c786ee5._CR0%2C0%2C447%2C447_UX460_SX48_.jpg",
        "video": {
          "link": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/6653ec2d-ca90-4426-8244-0549b772453b/embedded.cc.default.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8",
          "thumbnail": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kg-6f7-YL._SY500_.jpg"
        }
      },
      {
        "position": 5,
        "title": "Great value here",
        "text": "This set of flea/lice combs works great. Well made and comfortable handles...we have 3 dogs and use a different one for each because of the thickness or thinness of their coats. The tooth spacing is perfect and very fine so it will pick up anything in their fur with ease. Good size and good value for the money for sure as I've seen just one comb go for the same price...you get 6 with this set. Thumbs up!",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 7, 2026",
        "author": "S. Mcgrady",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AEK6YXYXFRC7PXTFKAE7LJNIISYA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"
      },
      {
        "position": 6,
        "title": "Perfect for keeping pets flea-free.",
        "text": "This set has several options that worked just great on my cats and my son's little dogs. We were able to get them practically flea-free. There are many different types of combs, so you can pick which one works best on different coats. They are made of quality material and feel sturdy enough to last for a long time. Highly recommend for any pet owner looking for an effective grooming solution.",
        "rating": 5,
        "date": "July 5, 2026",
        "author": "Tina B",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFE5V2VEGQN3LVMUFQ5WWAM57BDA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"
      },
      {
